  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     PHOTOGRAPHY GRID — proportions taken directly from the source
     layout screenshot. 4 base columns in ratio 5 : 4 : 6 : 5 (col 3
     is the widest so photo 10 reads as a large tile). 4 equal rows,
